  "body": "Currently moderators (PL 50) can enable e2ee which seems like a lot of responsibility given doing so is an irreversible action.\r\n\r\nInstead it would be better to limit it to admins with PL 100.\r\n\r\nI'm not proposing that existing rooms are changed retrospectively. \r\n",
